            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "11.2(b) An employee assigned to either Saturday or Sunday as a regular day of work shall receive $1.50 per hour added to his or her base salary and made a part thereof while so assigned. An employee assigned to both Saturday and Sunday as regular days of work shall receive $2.00 per hour added to his or her base salary and made a part thereof.",
